<p>In all honesty, about the only thing this shares with 3999 is the meta aspect and some of the bits in the middle, like the repeated Item number and description. There's <em>another</em> skip that this more closely resembles, but I am blanking on the number. 3005 is definitely a close second. Point is, 3999 is the easy go-to for &quot;this has been done because I can remember one article concretely&quot;.</p>
