<p>The overuse of &quot;$&quot; really killed it for me, I suggest you replace it with something else because it looks too distracting and it takes a lot out of the article's punch.</p>
<p>I don't really mind 3999 being namedropped, just so long as it adds a level of realism and immersion to the article.</p>
<p>That said, I think this needs just a little more time being worked on. I really enjoyed the format screw (despite some parts looking quite messed up and confusing) and I think it's not impossible to bring 3999 in an article; its just plain hard.</p>

